# Large asset folders live in their own Cloudflare Pages projects so the main
# project stays well under the 20,000-file deployment limit. Served cross-origin
# with CORS (Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *) so canvas draws stay untainted.
# 301 (not 302): browsers cache permanent redirects, so every repeat asset
# load skips the redirect round-trip instead of paying it forever.
# Short replay-share links: /r/<id> opens the replay viewer. 302 (not 301) —
# shared replays GC after 30 days, so browsers must not cache these forever.
/r/* /battlecards/index.html?rshare=:splat 302
# Micatro run replays (a whole run): /mr/<id> opens the replay viewer. 302 for the same reason.
/mr/* /micatro/?replay=:splat 302
# MicaSurvivor run replays (M5 batch 12c): /msr/<id> opens the replay player. 302 for the same reason.
/msr/* /micasurvivor/?replay=:splat 302
/battlecards/art/* https://magepunk-cardart.pages.dev/:splat 301
/overworld/data/* https://magepunk-owdata.pages.dev/:splat 301
/designwiki/sprites/* https://magepunk-sprites.pages.dev/:splat 301
